integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.source:
Some files already exist in the InkSim extension folder. Files listed for replacement may contain user changes. Other listed files will be preserved and never deleted.

Files to replace:
{replace_files}

Files to preserve:
{preserve_files}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.translation:
May ilang file nang nasa folder ng extension ng InkSim. Maaaring may mga pagbabago ng user ang mga file na nakalistang papalitan. Papanatilihin ang iba pang nakalistang file at hindi kailanman buburahin.

Mga file na papalitan:
{replace_files}

Mga file na papanatilihin:
{preserve_files}

Magpatuloy?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.source:
The listed user extension folders and all files inside them will be permanently deleted. The current install/update target and system extension folders will not be removed.

{directories}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.translation:
Permanenteng buburahin ang mga nakalistang folder ng user extension at lahat ng file sa mga ito. Hindi aalisin ang kasalukuyang target ng pag-install/pag-update at ang mga system extension folder.

{directories}

Magpatuloy?
